Z||000014||Terrybogin||10-04-1999||10:36 PM||||Chadman, <BR>I think my marriage has prepared me for Fiero ownership! Just give all the money to her and maybe I get lunch money for the next few days if I'm lucky. Push your luck and either one will leave you standing on the side of the road. Oh, and a lack of maintaince will only leave you frustrated, this is true of the car also.||||reg||1
Z||000015||Racer 1||10-05-1999||04:29 AM||||My Fiero has a poltergeist&lt;might be wrong spelling&gt; in her. She gets real mad when I work on my metro or touch my mustang. She usaully breaks down the next day. Im in the process of painting her so shes in a good mood even runs like new even though she has 206,000 mile on her. One time I let my friend take his girlfreind out in my fiero when I got the car back one mile up the road all 3 "yes" all 3 alternator bolts came loose and fell out. all the lights went out and I new she was pissed at me. Other time while im driving shes gives me fake check engine codes to try to scare my into a break down event. Maybe if I ever get married she'll get pissed and run over me?||||reg||11
